{"4063840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deliver Die Die", "steam_appid": 4063840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5118730], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NORMAL DELIVERY... OR IS IT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max is just an ordinary guy, living from one order to the next as a courier. But one day, his routine shatters. Disturbing posters of a missing girl appear all over the city. His next delivery takes him to a dark, long-abandoned building that would be better left alone. What was once a simple job turns into a deadly trap—one that won’t be easy to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/extras/01ce8d2198c0926ea201262d6fbde889.poster.avif?t=1787678468\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/extras/01ce8d2198c0926ea201262d6fbde889.webm?t=1787678468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/extras/01ce8d2198c0926ea201262d6fbde889.mp4?t=1787678468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>QTE – ACT FAST AND PRECISELY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience dynamic gameplay filled with Quick Time Events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive this nightmare, Max needs your help. Pass QTEs successfully to make him dodge, hide, or fight back at the right moment. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/extras/c023465b8288b0835d9177edfd6eacf0.poster.avif?t=1787678468\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"ht